=============

<Description>
  
 It requires volley.csv or tennis.csv under the same directory. This file generates the results of table 2.

<Usage>

  python3 table2_volley.py
  python3 table2_tennis.py

<Outputs>

  The result will show on the screen. For instance, output of tennis data are

  Table 2: Data statistics (Tennis)
  ============================================================
                     whole (once)     training     test (new)
  ------------------------------------------------------------
