=============

<Description> 

This file generates the result of Table 7 in the paper.

<Usage>

# in R console, do the following command:

source('table7.R')

<Outputs>

  The following results will show on the screen.


          Hermannova Slukova Toti Giombini
  win           46     158    2       41
  lose          63      97   18       69
  total        109     255   20      110


2.7 generateSimu.R
=============

<Description>

Generate data for simulation study of Table 8.

<Usage>

# in R console, do the following command:

source('generateSimu.R')

<Outputs>

  It produces the file "simu.csv", which is used in simulation study of Table 8.

2.8 simu_table8.py
=============

<Description>
  
It requires simu.csv under the same directory. This file generates the result of Table 8 in the paper.

<Usage>

  python3 simu_table8.py

<Outputs>

  The results will show on the screen.

  alpha_1 (for updating) & 0.20 & 0.30 & 0.40 & 0.50 & 0.60

  K = 18 & 0.3278 & 0.3278 & 0.3263 & 0.3246 & 0.3257

  K = 25 & 0.3280 & 0.3276 & 0.3270 & 0.3274 & 0.3267


The results were run under Python 3.12.4,  NumPy 2.1.1,  Pandas 2.2.2. R code were run under R 4.2.2.

